  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRENGTHENING REGIONAL SEA TURTLE CONSERVATION THROUGH THE SUPPORT OF THE INTER AMERICAN CONVENTION FOR THE PROTECTION AND CONSERVATION OF SEA TURTLES (IAC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The long-term goal of this project is to strengthen sea turtle conservation efforts and help the recovery of these species in the Americas, by supporting efforts to harmonize national legislation, conservation measures, capacity building, and outreach to more countries and key stakeholders to strengthen local and international collaboration throughout the region by the implementation of the IAC Convention.</narrative>
  </description>
